### Cadastro com dados validos (sucesso 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alberico",
    "email": "alberico@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Cadastro sem nome (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alberico@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Cadastro com email inválido (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alberico",
    "email": "albericoexample.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

